#: main.cpp:109
msgid ""
"<qt>Here you can change your personal information, which will be used, for "
"instance, in mail programs and word processors. You can change your login "
"password by clicking <em>Change Password...</em>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Disini anda boleh menukar maklumat peribadi, yang akan digunakan, "
"sebagai contoh, dalam program mel dan pemproses perkataan. Anda boleh "
"menukar katalaluan logmasuk dengan menklik <em>Tukar Katalaluan...</em>.</qt>"

#: main.cpp:123
msgid ""
"A program error occurred: the internal program 'kdepasswd' could not be "
"found. You will not be able to change your password."
msgstr ""
"Ralat program telah berlaku: program dalaman 'kdepasswd' tidak ditemui. Anda "
"tidak boleh mengubah kata laluan anda."

